  el0test              run an EL0 user task that must fault on kernel RAM
  wipe                 scrub all session RAM now (kill switch)
  panic                trigger a kernel panic (wipes on the way down)
  faulttest            trigger a fatal EL1 fault; proves it wipes before halt
  exit                 wipe and shut down the machine
